@ 10.3.2 - Proto-Oceanic to Hiw
# citation: thetha, from François, Alexander (2005), “Unraveling the history of the vowels of seventeen north Vanuatu languages”, and François, Alexander (2010), “Phonotactics and the prestopped velar lateral of Hiw”
	p pʷ {c,*j} k q → β βʷ s ɣ ∅
	β b m → βʷ bʷ mʷ / typically near *u
	dr *r → d r
	C → ∅ / _#
	ɲ → n
	b d ɡ → p t k
	βʷ bʷ mʷ → w kʷ ŋʷ
	l → j
	s → h → ∅
